 for Coins!"},{"heading":"3. Purchase useful items to aid in your Furniture collecting!","content":"Use the Terminal to purchase useful items, which arrive hourly in a Capsule."},{"heading":"4. Defend yourself","content":"Defend your Capsule as it boots up! Or your base during Closing Hours."},{"heading":"5. Send your Furniture home!","content":"Use the Capsule to send your furniture back home! This is how you take items out of the Liminal Dimension."}],"tags":["8a4ef929-2ffa-4dea-8a06-fdd3b2743b4f","0387ed69-d3c5-4330-bfc9-501175a2b05b","85f15371-8fc8-401d-b699-93116be1dd2b","tag.building","tag.difficult","tag.exploration","tag.fighting","tag.furniture","tag.horror","tag.procedural_generation","tag.scary_mobs","video_trailer","3P","addon","genre.survival","tag.vibrantvisuals","vvenhanced"],"contentSize":13465977.0,"downloadUrls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/3c00698e-725f-4f9c-9a3e-c4ca2ca01b76/primary.zip"],"downloadVariants":[{"label":"Standard","tags":[],"urls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/3c00698e-725f-4f9c-9a3e-c4ca2ca01b76/primary.zip"]}],"cdnUrls":["https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/3c00698e-725f-4f9c-9a3e-c4ca2ca01b76/primary.zip"],"legacyUrls":[],"downloadable":true}}